{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7668253978782779701","title":"AI产品经理（国际化广告方向） - 销售运营管理平台","description":"团队介绍：国际化销售运营管理平台团队成立于2022年1月，作为国际商业化产品与技术组织的一部分，整合了之前全球CRM（又名3M平台）团队的几个子支柱。我们的团队旨在赋能全球业务解决方案（GBS）团队，通过3M平台和生态系统中的工具和解决方案，通过高效的销售流程和可信的数据洞察，推动业务增长。\n\n1、洞察用户需求，理解业务场景，结合大模型技术能力做出创新AI产品体验；\n2、负责理想用户体验定义，体验衡量体系设计，产品和策略方案设计；\n3、深入策略迭代过程，牵引策略效果提升，组织协同各方达成业务目标。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历；\n2、对AI的能力边界和发展有判断力，有设计策略方案和产品实现的能力，有复杂项目实施运作的经历；\n3、具备敏锐的需求洞察力、良好的逻辑分析能力、产品策略判断能力以及跨团队协作能力；有自驱力、有责任心。","job_category":{"id":"6704215864629004552","name":"产品","en_name":"Product","i18n_name":"产品","depth":1,"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785404598563,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A93602","job_id":"7668254265390926133","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":